---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: IT Training
description: "Structured programs in web development, QA, cloud, and data — built for graduates who want training that leads somewhere specific: a job."
glass: true
extraScripts:
  - /assets/js/count-up.js
  - /assets/js/faq-accordion.js
  - /assets/js/candidate-route.js
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

{# ================================================================
   IT TRAINING — creative redesign (see claude_helper/IT-TRAINING-PAGE.md).

   The learner / early-funnel page. Same IA:
     Hero → Journey → Tracks → Why → Outcomes → Cost → Process → FAQ → CTA
   The recurring device is a LEARNING ROUTE — Skill → Project → Certification →
   Placement — built from the shared candidate-route.njk. Drawn incomplete in the
   hero; candidate-route.js advances it and the process route on scroll.

   Content rules unchanged: NEVER "guaranteed placement" — always "direct" /
   "priority access". Track curricula (programs.json) stay gated; ship the
   waitlist variant if they are not real. One accent CTA only (the hero demo
   button). Stats stay confirmation-gated.
   ================================================================ #}

{% set crumbs = [{ label: "Home", url: "/" }, { label: "Services", url: "/services/" }, { label: "IT Training" }] %}
{% set routeNodes = [
  { label: "Learn" }, { label: "Build" }, { label: "Certify" },
  { label: "Get ready" }, { label: "Placement" }
] %}

{# ---------- 1. Hero — 12-column, a learning route over the photo ---------- #}
<section data-route-step="1" class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="section-container pb-14 pt-8 sm:pb-20 sm:pt-12">
    {% include "partials/breadcrumb.njk" %}

    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:pr-8">
        <p class="eyebrow">Four tracks, one placement pipeline</p>

        <h1 class="mt-4 font-grotesk text-[2.75rem] font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
          Train. Certify.<br>Get placed.
        </h1>
        <p class="lead-copy mt-6 max-w-xl">
          Structured programs that build real skills — and feed straight into our
          placement pipeline when you're done.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          {# The one accent-coloured button on the site — this audience is earlier
             in the funnel and more exploratory (PRD §7). #}
          <a href="{{ '/contact/?role=training' | url }}"
             class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3.5
                    font-semibold text-paper shadow-card duration-200 ease-out
                    transition-[transform,background-color] hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-deep">
            {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }} Book a free demo class
          </a>
          <a href="{{ '/services/job-placement/' | url }}" class="btn-outline">
            See job placement {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}
          </a>
        </div>

        {# The learning route, drawn at its first node. #}
        {% set routeActive = 1 %}
        {% set routeProgress = true %}
        <div class="mt-12 max-w-lg">
          {% include "partials/candidate-route.njk" %}
        </div>

        {# TODO — confirm every figure with the client before launch (stats.json). #}
        <dl class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-12 gap-y-5 border-t border-ink/10 pt-6">
          {% for stat in stats.list.slice(0, 3) %}
          <div>
            <dd class="font-mono text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl"
                data-count-up data-target="{{ stat.value }}" data-suffix="{{ stat.suffix }}">0{{ stat.suffix }}</dd>
            <dt class="stat-label">{{ stat.label }}</dt>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        {% set coverImage = images.services["it-training"].cover %}
        <figure class="jp-frame">
          <span class="jp-frame-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <div class="jp-frame-media jp-reveal">
            <img src="{{ coverImage.url }}"
                 alt="{{ coverImage.alt }}"
                 width="1400" height="1750" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"
                 class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover">
          </div>

          {# A four-stage learning route over the photo — conceptual, never implies a
             guaranteed job. #}
          <ol class="it-route-chip" aria-hidden="true">
            {% for stage in ["Skill", "Project", "Certify", "Placement"] %}
            <li class="it-route-chip-node{% if loop.first %} is-lit{% endif %}">
              <span class="it-route-chip-dot"></span>{{ stage }}
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ol>

          <figcaption class="jp-frame-caption">Cohort in session</figcaption>

          <div class="glass-frost jp-fee">
            <p class="meta">Placement pipeline</p>
            <p class="font-grotesk text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Direct access</p>
          </div>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 2. The journey — learning should lead somewhere ----------
   The mental model for everything that follows: a course is worth it when you can
   point to what you built and what happens next. ---------- #}
<section class="border-y border-white/60 bg-paper/50 py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="assertion text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Learning should lead somewhere.</p>
        <p class="body-copy mt-4 max-w-xl">
          A course is useful when you can point to what you built, what you
          learned, and what happens next.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        {% set journeyNodes = [
          { label: "Learn" }, { label: "Build" }, { label: "Certify" },
          { label: "Get ready" }, { label: "Placement" }
        ] %}
        <ol class="candidate-route candidate-route-y mx-auto max-w-[14rem] lg:mx-0" aria-hidden="true">
          {% for node in journeyNodes %}
          <li class="candidate-route-node is-lit"><span class="candidate-route-dot"></span><span class="candidate-route-label">{{ node.label }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 3. Tracks offered — full-width panels, a route through them ----------
   Duration, format and prerequisites stay on the panel (a learner filters on
   these first). Each panel is one route to the same next stage. ---------- #}
<section id="programs" data-route-step="2" class="section-container scroll-mt-28 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="section-title">Tracks offered.</h2>
    <p class="lead-copy mt-4">Four programs, each ending at the same place — a portfolio project and a handoff to placement.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="it-tracks mt-12">
    {% for program in programs.list %}
    {% set shot = images.services["it-training"].tracks[program.title] %}
    <article class="it-track glass-panel overflow-hidden !pt-0 md:grid md:grid-cols-12">
      {% if shot %}
      <div class="it-track-media md:col-span-4 {% if loop.index is even %}md:order-last{% endif %}">
        <img src="{{ shot.url }}" alt="{{ shot.alt }}" width="{{ shot.width }}" height="{{ shot.height }}"
             loading="lazy" class="h-44 w-full object-cover md:h-full">
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="p-5 sm:p-7 {% if shot %}md:col-span-8{% else %}md:col-span-12{% endif %}">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="it-track-num">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <span class="it-track-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="text-ink/30">{{ icon(program.icon, "w-4 h-4") }}</span>
          <span class="meta ml-auto">{{ program.duration }}</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">{{ program.title }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 body-copy">{{ program.description }}</p>
        <dl class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-dashed border-border pt-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col-reverse">
            <dt class="mt-1 meta">Format</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">{{ program.format }}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col-reverse">
            <dt class="mt-1 meta">Prerequisites</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">{{ program.prerequisites }}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 4. Why train with us — the file is already open ----------
   Priority access, never a guarantee. ---------- #}
<section id="why" class="scroll-mt-28 border-y border-white/60 bg-paper/50 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <p class="it-file-tag">Placement file<span>Open</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-10 max-w-3xl">
        <p class="assertion text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
          Graduates get <span class="text-brand">direct access to our placement pipeline</span> — the file is already open on the day you certify.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
          That's priority access, not a guarantee. It's the difference between an
          open application and a recruiter who already knows your work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 5. What you get at the end — three milestone artifacts ---------- #}
<section id="credential" class="section-container scroll-mt-28 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="section-title">What you get at the end.</h2>
  </div>

  {% set outcomes = [
    { icon: "check-badge", t: "A completion certificate", d: "Issued by " + site.companyName + ", naming the track and the hours behind it." },
    { icon: "code", t: "A portfolio project", d: "Something you can show an employer, not a printable PDF." },
    { icon: "briefcase", t: "A handoff to placement", d: "A direct introduction into our Job Placement pipeline." }
  ] %}
  <ol class="it-artifacts mt-12">
    {% for item in outcomes %}
    <li class="it-artifact">
      <span class="it-artifact-num">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
      <span class="it-artifact-icon">{{ icon(item.icon, "w-5 h-5") }}</span>
      <h3 class="card-title mt-4">{{ item.t }}</h3>
      <p class="body-copy mt-1.5">{{ item.d }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>

  <p class="jp-note mt-12 max-w-2xl">
    Where a track prepares you for a vendor exam, we say which one and whether the
    exam fee is included — ask us for the track you're considering.
  </p>
</section>

{# ---------- 6. What it costs — four payment paths ---------- #}
<section id="pricing" class="scroll-mt-28 border-y border-white/60 bg-paper/50 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="section-title">What it costs.</h2>
      <p class="lead-copy mt-4">
        Fees vary by track and format — ask for your track and we'll send exact
        figures. However you pay, it works one of these ways:
      </p>
    </div>

    {% set paymentOptions = [
      { t: "Pay in full", d: "One payment at enrollment." },
      { t: "Installment plan", d: "A deposit at enrollment, the balance split across the program." },
      { t: "Employer reimbursement", d: "We provide the documentation your employer's tuition-assistance program needs." },
      { t: "Placement-linked deferral", d: "On select tracks — reduced cost at enrollment, the balance due after you're placed." }
    ] %}
    <ol class="it-pay mt-10">
      {% for option in paymentOptions %}
      <li class="it-pay-row">
        <span class="it-pay-num">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">{{ option.t }}</p>
          <p class="body-copy mt-1">{{ option.d }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>

    <a href="{{ '/contact/?role=training' | url }}" class="mt-8 link-arrow">
      Tell us your track and we'll send exact pricing {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 7. The process — the learning pipeline ----------
   Ends at the same Job Placement file. Horizontal route / vertical on mobile;
   the current stage lights as the reader scrolls. No durations. ---------- #}
<section id="procedure" data-route-step="3" class="section-container scroll-mt-28 py-16 sm:py-24">
  {% set steps = [
    { label: "Enroll", description: "Pick a track and a format — online, in-person, or both." },
    { label: "Learn", description: "Structured curriculum built around real job requirements." },
    { label: "Practice", description: "A portfolio-ready project you can show employers." },
    { label: "Certification", description: "A credential that signals real, tested skill." },
    { label: "Placement support", description: "Direct handoff into our Job Placement pipeline." }
  ] %}
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Step by step</p>
    <h2 class="section-title mt-2">From enrollment to placement.</h2>
  </div>

  <ol class="jp-journey mt-14" data-jp-journey>
    {% for step in steps %}
    <li class="jp-journey-step{% if loop.first %} is-current{% endif %}" data-jp-node>
      <span class="jp-journey-num">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
      <span class="jp-journey-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="jp-journey-label">{{ step.label }}</p>
      <p class="jp-journey-desc">{{ step.description }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

{# ---------- 8. FAQ — the learner's checklist ---------- #}
{% set faqKey = "it-training" %}
{% set faqTitle = "Before you enroll." %}
{% include "partials/faq-route.njk" %}

{# ---------- 9. Closing CTA ---------- #}
{% set ctaStamp = "Ready when you are" %}
{% set ctaHeadline = "Ready to build a new skill set?" %}
{% set ctaSubtext = "Sit in on a demo class first — there's no cost and no commitment." %}
{% set ctaLabel = "Enroll Now" %}
{% set ctaHref = "/contact/?role=training" %}
{% include "partials/cta-section.njk" %}
